REMARK   3  OTHER REFINEMENT REMARKS:                                           
REMARK   3  GLU 119 (BOTH SUBUNITS) APPEARS ON THE ELECTRON DENSITY             
REMARK   3  TO BE COVALENTLY MODIFIED.  THE NATURE OF THE MODIFICATION          
REMARK   3  IS UNKNOWN AND IT HAS NOT BEEN MODELLED.  THE APPEARANCE            
REMARK   3  OF THE ELECTRON DENSITY IS CONSISTENT WITH OE1 REPLACED             
REMARK   3  BY A HYDROXYLAMINE GROUP.  THE MODIFICATION IS ALSO                 
REMARK   3  OBSERVED IN THE STRUCTURE OF NATIVE, OXIDIZED SOD.                  
REMARK   3  THEREFORE, IT CANNOT BE AN ARTIFACT OF THE TREATMENT WITH           
REMARK   3  DITHIONITE, USED IN REDUCING THE ENZYME.  THE POSITION OF           
REMARK   3  THE MODIFICATION RELATIVE TO THE ACTIVE SITE SUGGESTS A             
REMARK   3  ROLE IN THE REACTION MECHANISM.  SEE THE PAPER CITED ON             
REMARK   3  JRNL RECORDS ABOVE FOR DETAILS.                                     
